<title>JAPAN: Weak yen helps Sony boost profits -- Sony president.</title>
<headline>Weak yen helps Sony boost profits -- Sony president.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A weak yen automatically helps Sony Corp boost its profits, Sony president Nobuyuki Idei told Reuters on Thursday.  </p>
<p>&quot;(The) weak yen is automatically giving us a position of a bigger profit,&quot; Idei said, although he added that the movement of one currency was not a major issue for Sony and that economic downturns in parts of the world had more impact.</p>
</text>
